      "body": "Sri Lotus Developers & Realty Limited has announced its expansion into the GIFT City Area, Gandhinagar through a development agreement (DA) with Shri Abhishek Bachchan. The project will have a built-up area of over 1 million sq. ft. The Company has made a strategic entry into the GIFT City area, Gandhinagar with an ultra-luxury, mixed-use development on freehold land, marking Lotus' first project in Gujarat and a key milestone in its growth journey beyond its core Mumbai market. The project will be undertaken through subsidiary of the Company \"Rise Root Projects Pvt. Ltd.' which entered into a Development Agreement with Shri Ab hishek Bachchan having profit-sharing arrangement, enabling the Company to leverage its core strengths in design, planning, development, and execution. This asset-l",
